awk -f summarize-continuation.awk continuation.raw.tsv > continuation.tsv
exit_status=0
summary_timestamp=2026-07-20 04:52:21 UTC

The final verifier whitelists marker events and accepts only these exact
per-problem terminal sequences:

34: continuation_enter, status-124
41: continuation_enter, continuation_none, continuation_enter,
    continuation_none, continuation_enter, status-124
45: continuation_enter, status-124

It rejects stdout, multiple or non-124 statuses, missing terminal status, and
every record after status.

